    "detailed_description": "You have been hired to fix anything that breaks at the popular children's arcade &quot;Dinobag's Arcade&quot;. Each night you are given a list of things to fix, and it is your job to fix them... and then escape the monsters that haunt the arcade. Each night you receive a note with a list of things to fix, and then you must move around the arcade fixing those things while evading the arcade's 5 mascots to try to escape with your life for 6 nights straight. Armed with nothing but a flashlight and the tools to fix the electronics that break, you're in for a tough night, and a life of reoccurring nightmares, or no life at all.",
    "about_the_game": "You have been hired to fix anything that breaks at the popular children's arcade &quot;Dinobag's Arcade&quot;. Each night you are given a list of things to fix, and it is your job to fix them... and then escape the monsters that haunt the arcade. Each night you receive a note with a list of things to fix, and then you must move around the arcade fixing those things while evading the arcade's 5 mascots to try to escape with your life for 6 nights straight. Armed with nothing but a flashlight and the tools to fix the electronics that break, you're in for a tough night, and a life of reoccurring nightmares, or no life at all.",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Dinobag's Arcade, a fun place for children of all ages to have fun and play with our mascots Kevin, Madelyn, Liam, Catherine, and our star Daniel Dinobag. Unfortunately, all our electronics keep breaking. We need you to come in, fix them, and of course, enjoy the show.",
